            <note corresp="#d187-f2" n="2" xml:id="d187-f2-content">
                <p>For a summary of this meeting, which was attended by Rostow, Bowdler,
                        Gordon, Sayre, Bunker, Crimmins, Broe, Esterline, Townsend W. Hoopes, and William E. Lang, the
                    latter two Deputy Assistant Secretaries of Defense for International Security
